        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "I apologize if this has been cleared up in another thread.  I swear I remember reading about it somewhere, but I can't find the thread, so maybe I'm just crazy.  If I have Twist the Ether out and something deals multiple doses of damage (i.e. \"All heroes take X damage\"), does Twist the Ether change all of it to a single damage type (i.e. cold -> fire), or does it change a single instance of that damage (i.e. Legacy takes the regular cold damage, but Ra takes fire damage)?",
