        "id": 23897,
        "name": "WriterRyan",
        "username": "WriterRyan",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/writerryan/{size}/2710_2.png",
        "created_at": "2011-11-03T20:56:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If it says something like “All heroes take 2 cold damage”, you could use it to change damage to all heroes to fire (or whatever else you choose). If it says something like “All heroes take 2 cold damage and 3 fire damage”, you could change it to 2 lightning damage and radiant damage. However, you wouldn’t be able to split it up by hero and say, “Ok, Ra takes 2 fire damage, and Absolute Zero takes 2 cold damage, and Fanatic takes 2 radiant damage, and etc…”</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
